  "question": "Let $X$ be the set $\\{1,2,3,\\ldots,10\\}$ and $P$ the subset $\\{1,2,3,4,5\\}$. The number of subsets $Q$ of $X$ such that $P\\cap Q=\\{3\\}$ is",
